@startuml
title Process Sale State Machine

[*] --> WaitingForSale

state WaitingForSale
WaitingForSale : entry / Display Welcome Message

state AddingItems
AddingItems : entry / Customer selects item
AddingItems : do / Add item to sale
AddingItems : exit / All items added

state Payment
Payment : entry / Move to payment
Payment : do / Verify payment method
Payment : exit / Payment approved or declined

WaitingForSale --> AddingItems : New sale started
AddingItems --> Payment : All items added
Payment --> WaitingForSale : Payment approved
Payment --> WaitingForSale : Payment declined

state CashPayment
CashPayment : entry / Customer pays with cash
CashPayment : do / Complete sale immediately
CashPayment : exit / Sale completed

state CardPayment
CardPayment : entry / Customer chooses to pay by card or check
CardPayment : do / Verify payment
CardPayment : exit / Payment approved

Payment --> CashPayment : Customer pays with cash
Payment --> CardPayment : Customer chooses to pay by card or check
CardPayment --> WaitingForSale : Payment approved
CashPayment --> WaitingForSale : Sale completed

@enduml
